!packaging/homebrew/README.md
!apps/cli/README.md
!docs/homebrew.md


# FoxFlow's local SQLite DB (sibling project) — never belongs in this repo.
# Its credentials/variables tables can hold real secrets.
#
# This is a backstop, not the fix. FoxFlow used to default to the bare relative
# path 'foxflow.sqlite', so it created its database in whatever directory a
# command was run from — including this one. FoxFlow now anchors the default to
# its own repo root (packages/storage/src/database-path.ts), so a file should
# no longer appear here. If one does, something is running with the old default.
foxflow.sqlite
foxflow.sqlite-shm
foxflow.sqlite-wal
